Modifying data in a table in DynamoDB
In DynamoDB, you can use either the DynamoDB API or PartiQL (a SQL-compatible query 
language) to modify a single item. If you want to modify multiple items, you must use multiple 
operations.
DynamoDB API
With the DynamoDB API, you use the UpdateItem operation to modify a single item.
